---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const description='Contact Deskutil by email about the site, a specific tool, or privacy. Reach Juan at marcosjuan17@gmail.com. There is no account system or form backend.';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact Deskutil — Email Juan About Site or Tools" description={description} canonical="https://deskutil.com/contact/">
<article class="shell page-heading prose">
<p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
<h1>Email Juan about the site or a tool.</h1>
<p>Deskutil has no accounts and no contact-form backend. The public address is <a href="mailto:marcosjuan17@gmail.com">marcosjuan17@gmail.com</a>. Your email app opens a message; nothing is submitted through this page.</p>
<h2>What to write about</h2>
<ul>
<li>The site itself: a broken page, a confusing label, or an idea for a focused tool.</li>
<li>A specific utility, such as the <a href="/finance/gst-calculator/">GST calculator</a> or a developer tool on the <a href="/">homepage</a>.</li>
<li>Privacy questions, including how browser tools and possible future ads are described on the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> page.</li>
</ul>
<p>Please include the page URL when you can. For a head start, use <a href="mailto:marcosjuan17@gmail.com?subject=Deskutil%20site">site</a>, <a href="mailto:marcosjuan17@gmail.com?subject=Deskutil%20tool">tool</a>, or <a href="mailto:marcosjuan17@gmail.com?subject=Deskutil%20privacy">privacy</a> as the subject.</p>
<p>More about who runs this is on the <a href="/about/">About</a> page.</p>
</article>
</BaseLayout>
